OL,3,GNEWSAFire-damaged school's new play
OL,4,Aarea wins award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school which suffered a
OL,7,Fdevastating fire has marked its
OL,8,Frecovery with an award for its new
OL,9,Foutdoor play area.
OL,11,FWoodborough Primary School, near Pewsey
OL,12,Fin Wiltshire, was badly damaged in the
OL,13,Ffire in 2021, with 70 firefighters
OL,14,Fbattling the blaze at its peak.
OL,16,FPupils returned to the site a week
OL,17,Flater using temporary buildings, and
OL,18,Fthe school spent 18 months revamping
OL,19,Fits outdoor facilities, which recently
OL,20,Fearned the Outdoor Play and Learning
OL,21,F(OPAL) platinum award.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
