OL,3,GNEWSAFire-damaged school's new play
OL,4,Aarea wins award
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Banham, chair of governors, said:
OL,7,F"There are fairy doors in trees, trees
OL,8,Fto climb, rope swings, a shepherd hut
OL,9,Ffor quiet contemplation, scooters for
OL,10,Fthe older children. The children are
OL,11,Fmore or less policing themselves."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
